@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Feature Specification: Availability
+
+**Input**: `availability(query)` on the rental service, `query = { start, end, kind? }`; returns sorted ids of equipment (of `kind`, or any kind) free for the whole period.
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: Period rules are those of `quote`/`book` (UTC midnight ISO-8601, end after start); violations throw.
+- **FR-002**: An item is free if no booking of it overlaps the period (half-open intervals, so back-to-back is free).
+- **FR-003**: `kind` optional; if given it must be `board` or `sail`, otherwise throws.
+- **FR-004**: Result is an array of ids sorted ascending (default string order); empty when nothing is free.
+
+## Tasks
+- [x] Tests in test/rental.test.ts
+- [x] Implement in src/index.ts
+- [x] `npm test`
